Replacement assets for PictaFront

Nothing in this directory is OpenFront Inc.'s proprietary artwork, font or
audio. Each file replaces the upstream file at the same path under proprietary/
when the self-hosted image is built (selfhost/apply.sh). Despite the directory
name, which the build requires, every file here is openly licensed:

images/*
  Original artwork made for this fork: a 5x7 pixel wordmark and monogram drawn
  in selfhost/make-assets.py, which generates every file in images/.
  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
  License, like the repository's other assets:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

fonts/OpenFront.ttf
  Press Start 2P by CodeMan38 (The Press Start 2P Project Authors), unmodified,
  from https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/pressstart2p at commit
  dbd72d6ef9ebea750d33c02c7189633e972d6a40. Only the file is renamed, to the
  path the game loads. Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, with
  Reserved Font Name "Press Start 2P": see fonts/OFL.txt.

sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3
  A copy of resources/sounds/effects/game-start.mp3 from this repository, by
  OpenFront and Contributors, licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (resources/LICENSE).

sounds/music/menu-theme.mp3
sounds/music/gameplay.mp3
  Five seconds of digital silence, generated by selfhost/make-assets.py. No
  copyrightable content; dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0:
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
